  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for a P3 position at the UNSD directed towards the Data4Now initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">For UNSD to continue taking a leading role and helping ensure that as many countries as possible can benefit from the approach and work of the Data4Now initiative, support is given to UNSD for a full-time position at P3 level, for a period of up to two years.</narrative>
  </description>
